<title>JAPAN: Murata Mfg shares down on weak earnings.</title>
<headline>Murata Mfg shares down on weak earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Murata Mfg Co Ltd slipped on Thursday morning, as participants discouraged by its earnings report released on Wednesday took profits, traders said.</p>
<p>Murata shares lost 100 yen to trade at 4,300 at 0053 GMT. Its turnover was 163,000 shares.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the major maker of ceramic capacitors said its group net profit declined to 32.59 billion yen for the year to March 31, 1997, from a group net profit of 37.24 billion yen a year earlier.</p>
